: "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GGXHnWlwSZsQ7kNvwE1SDS9&_nc_oc=Adp_7fL3ciewMQq4XiWUw-IDBq4_7ftyIViJH-XACJL2omfRi5ayrzwGTnq1lei8Gl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0XiVCI_xpaIvxUGR2jnS6xG4pm_VRaXV34gHEo7M7FKg&oe=69E78D24"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1oEHZfjLdmIQ7kNvwF-7WRh&_nc_oc=AdqnfHDFXC8F3zWNJ3gVsB8sj08eKpPZ_cfEupKpDBdI50lpB6RKex1-dUmbSV4guJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1q5BWbhB5ux7-12S1oHUpe2GAPUr3slBiYC4JLks2y0w&oe=69E770AC"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aRl3yV4rGC4Q7kNvwEA5TDB&_nc_oc=Adre8WD3NyNC5lxOv9_cvyXHYaGV8gdQlI3UAfCXFjDHonJYQ0SXMBTDCRxIL0oweGo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af32LipTsLJEpnC8vau5kUIQJKp--byDydrMLAp03yQe9A&oe=69E76F9C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w6_q4QoBpSYQ7kNvwHp9wQo&_nc_oc=Adr_My1HHdnXrk6Hu9oSUoN0R8LTrsNH4rY2PW7nHb1Pp5JPo7nBGONhpXK-7LfU3xA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0xpeE6Em5in7R9eI-STilZJd-5HOnSLqiAlsrA7AtZfA&oe=69E7631D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nA3pdOHU08QQ7kNvwGI9gBM&_nc_oc=AdpeWQlz1HmH9ihXDamAvyaK1jREqgKp2Jk7yG-4T99qvuJJYkIluNTmYqxTY2cp8Kc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3-lB5agPaN7UOZQ9xWguNGsKQ1dn8wA6FPxYvS7ZIgpA&oe=69E7684F"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer